    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 04/13/23 11:50:49 AM: Cut a piece of 22ga at 3\". Left side is within .001. All the way through the middle and further is within .003-.004. The far right side is off .007-.008. We cut a piece at 7.20 with the same results. Backgauge is within tolerance for our prints. If they continue to have problems with this, I will investigate further to figure out what the issue is.",
