    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 01/25/24 10:39:10 AM: We sold the machine. | Preston Ellexson - 05/11/23  8:53:51 AM: The backgauge is moving forward when the shear is started and stopped. From behind, the right side belt(operators side) for the backgauge is really worn out. The left side is in really good condition. Not sure what's causing this, but I'm working with Greg @ Capital on the issue. Machine isn't a safety concern and can remain in production.",
