    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 11/07/23  5:21:04 AM: Sheet detector plate was very badly bent due to an accidental crash on Saturday. Matthew John also said that the metal skit plate really needs to be moved back further as well. We removed the metal stop plate and I had him torch the holes out to slot them for more adjustability. I took apart everything mounted on the sheet detector plate. Brought to maintenance to straighten. Cleaned up some threads on the plates as well. Got everything mounted back up. Got laser on and ready. Had Matthew John move suction table down while I waited to tell him when to E-stop. Everything is clear and the load table doesn't hit the material stop on the ground anymore. Machine is running good, I am just monitoring the barrier/cabinet issues from last week.",
