    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "06/07/2024 07:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 06/07/24  5:48:28 AM: Got both nitrogen generators, and the booster compressor mounted with 3/8\" anchors. While I was here, I shut needed valves to fix the air leak coming out of the second generator. Removed fitting and cleaned all pipe dope off. Cleaned off female elbow as well. Taped up with the green oxygen tape. Got fitting back and tight. Tightened coupler fittings back and tested. No leaks anymore. Purity levels are better now without the oxygen not back feeding into the 2nd generator.",
    "attachments": []
  },
