    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 06/26/24  5:52:58 AM: Disregard comment below. This was a different line. 4mm line needed replaced inside the head assembly. Removed needed covers and fed new line through. Got zip tied up and had Matthew John put head back on. Tested and everything is working good. Machine hasn't shut down due to this error again. | Preston Ellexson - 06/26/24  4:23:12 AM: New line should be here today. We have had enough slack inside the machine casing that we have been able to just cut and repair. Happened again this morning.",
