    "completed_datetime": "06/27/2024 07:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 06/27/24 12:15:45 PM: Festo tubing arrived yesterday. I got this all swapped out with new first thing this morning. Zip tied all lines back where they were originally. I ordered 50' and only used about 8' so we have spare in maintenance. Tested machine and everything is running good with no leaks. Been running all day. | Preston Ellexson - 06/21/24  4:10:05 AM: A main incoming air hose to a block on the loading table was cracked. It was split in the tracking above. Didn't have any barbs here. Went to Lowe's and got a few extra. Cut the bad spot and put a brass double barb in place. A couple hours later, the same line busted at the fitting behind the white cover on the load table. Removed cover and cut bad spot. Put line back on and tested. Everything is good. Yesterday the same thing happened at the fitting again. Repaired and tested. Machine is good. I am ordering new line for that. Hopefully it will not keep cracking until it arrives.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
