    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/31/24  7:25:32 AM: Removed needed covers. Checked for any air leaks inside and around the cutting head. No air leaks anywhere. When inspecting the seals that go to the cutting head, we realized 2 were pretty bad. Replaced all 3 with new and put covers and everything back together. Tested and it is working good now. We still have 3 more seals, and we haven't replaced those in 3-5 years so they'll last awhile.",
    "attachments": []
  },
