    "completed_datetime": "03/07/2025 02:00 PM",
    "comments": "Scott Herbert - 03/18/25  9:03:49 AM: 3/28/25: Closed by PSH. Trumpf tech was here and replaced regulator. | Preston Ellexson - 09/17/24 12:24:35 PM: We've cleaned the filters 2 Fridays in a row now. Removed all diaphragms and inspected. None have holes or are cracked at all. They were dirty so I cleaned with a dry rag. The regulator for the purge is only getting 1-1.5 bar. That is part of our issue. Tech doesn't know if it's the valve/filter/regulator or something wrong with one of the air lines. We are ordering a valve/regulator and I'll go from there. | Preston Ellexson - 08/26/24 10:39:16 AM: This weekend would be a great time to clean these filters out and let them dry over the long weekend. I'm awaiting a part to arrive on another machine. Depending on its arrival will determine if I have time to get these removed and cleaned Friday. I'll get with Paul and Shacole as soon as the other delivery arrives here. | Preston Ellexson - 08/15/24 12:35:37 PM: I am getting with a tech to get procedure for cleaning this filter housing out.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1633",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1633",
