    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "11/04/2025 02:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 11/05/25  6:36:38 AM: Matthew John and I started this repair 10/31. We got the front bellows swapped out. We removed the back ones and realized they are the same as the front ones, but we have 2 new with different part #'s. One of the ones we ordered does not fit where the manual says. I need to see about and RMA or if it belongs somewhere else on the machine. The rear bellows were actually not damaged. We replaced the bellow bracket/mount with new, but used the old bellows with no issues. We replaced front and back shutters for the cutting head enclosure. Lastly we got the shield pins enclosure swapped out with new. When attempting to run, we kept getting an error. Shield pins down limit is not being seen. After working back and forth with tech support 11/3 and 11/4, we found the issue. There was a missing bracket that belongs on the shield pins enclosure that we didn't know was supposed to be there. Found an old one in the toolbox that wasn't too damaged. Got it straightened up and installed. I have the drawing if we need to make a new one though. Had to slot out the lower prox switch bracket more than the factory slot. After making numerous adjustments to the shield pin height, we finally got the machine back up and running. Put on all covers and machine is ready to run. | Preston Ellexson - 10/24/25 12:17:25 PM: I will get this done within the next 2 weeks. We have been waiting for their production schedule to have a little flex for this. Should take less than 4 hours with me and Matthew John doing this together. I will get with Shacole next Monday and see if any day looks good. | Preston Ellexson - 09/30/25 10:11:18 AM: Followed up with Shacole again on this today. We are going to see if we can get this done next week sometime. I will get with her 10/6 to see how her production schedule looks. | Preston Ellexson - 08/20/25  4:29:34 AM: Shacole is off all week. I got with her before and she wanted me to wait until she came back and they got an updated production schedule. She will be back 8/25. I'll get with her then and see if we have a better date in mind for this. | Preston Ellexson - 08/11/25  5:26:14 AM: Working with Shacole on a time for this repair. We are going to wait until next week at least with the way their production schedule looks this week. | Preston Ellexson - 07/28/25 12:23:19 PM: Parts got ordered today. | Preston Ellexson - 07/25/25 12:14:14 PM: Sent quote to Paul today. All parts say in stock. | Preston Ellexson - 07/24/25  4:06:22 AM: I was working yesterday with Trumpf tech on correct part #'s. I am sending in today for a quote and will forward it when I receive it.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
