    "completed_datetime": "01/06/2026 12:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 01/12/26 11:24:33 AM: We tried multiple times to get this to work. After looking closer, there was an open hole on a bracket for the unload frame. It is a mechanical stop for the height sensor. The bolt broke and the stop had fallen inside some drop on the pallet. Removed broken threads and cleaned female threads on stop. Put stop back on the bracket with a new bolt. Cycled machine power down and restarted. Everything is working good now. We went ahead and ordered some more of the stops. They are the same on the load and unload sides.",
    "attachments": []
  },
