    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 02/02/26 12:02:35 PM: Got the fence measured and put up, piece by piece. Shacole and Matthew John are good with the cage wall on just one side. If I need to put more up after the MSA, I'll do it then. | Preston Ellexson - 02/02/26  4:30:56 AM: Got with Shacole on this. I'll get parts in and start shortly.",
    "attachments": []
