    "completed_datetime": "07/27/2026 02:30 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/12/26  5:19:02 AM: I removed the sheet separator assembly and brought to maintenance. The tracking was off because some of the screws came loose. The tracking is made out of a machinable plastic, and it is just worn down. I put thread tape around every screw for the remaining pieces. I also put superglue on them all when assembling. Took to the machine and got it all set back up and plugged in. We tested and it is working well. If this needs repaired again, I'll remake the plastic tracking. There have been 2 missing for awhile. No issues right now.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "1633",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 1633",
