    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/29/24  8:50:26 AM: Checked for leak. Found 2 screws a little loose coming off of a pipe fitting. Tightened up and the leak stopped. Cleaned all water. There is a drain in the bottom, but it was plugged underneath. Had to have Jimmie help me remove it due to location. Got the plug out and swiveled the fitting towards the outside of the laser. Put a piece of clear tubing on for visual. Added a fitting and the plug back in. We might just have to drain the little bit every week or so.",
