    "comments": "Mark Zeober - 06/02/22  4:19:24 AM: Installed the new Air Booster system & adjusted the pressure to 140psi.  Ran a sample run and found the machine is now running much more consistent than before (originally +/- .125, after first set of modifications  +/- .03, after Booster install +/- .012). This is sufficient enough to hold and maintain all Bobrick tolerances.  Jose & I have released the CTL Line machine to go back into service effective 5/24/22 | Mark Zeober - 05/19/22  8:30:06 AM: Fabricated A panel to mount all the Regulators, Filters, Booster, 3 way valve, and Lubricator. Assembled Panel and the Booster components to the  Panel.  Anchored panel to the floor, plumbed in the air circuits, and function tested. Now I need to run a production test. | Mark Zeober - 05/06/22 10:56:37 AM: need to build pedestal to mount New Regulator, Booster and Lubricator.  waiting for Lubricator to arrive.",
    "attachments": []
  },
