    "comments": "Mark Zeober - 09/14/22 10:44:44 AM: When I checked on the issue with not shearing.  First I checked hydraulic Pressure by adding a pressure gage.  Pressure is good (2600psi).  I found 2 broke bolts that secure the die frame to the machine and I replaced them.  Also while working on the machine I noticed that the air booster was bypassing (sounds like a bad air leak).  This was caused by someone adjusting the pressure incorrectly.  The booster system is a delicate system and can be adjusted by maintenance personnel only.",
