    "completed_datetime": "02/10/2025 02:30 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/06/25  5:46:55 AM: Got the new pump in. Put everything back together. Cleaned up any oil mess. Replaced seal material on hydraulic tank and used foam material. Got all lines tied back in and tight. Double checked everything before turning machine power on. Got Shelley to setup machine. Helped her get it all going. Had to make adjustments on the shims of each die. Cleaned aluminum rollers due to wear marks denting material. Used scotch brite and cleaned them manually. Got everything set and the machine is running good. | Preston Ellexson - 02/05/25  6:26:31 AM: Removed cover on hydraulic tank. Found the pump was cracked again. Removed it and brought to maintenance. New pump was ordered and is expected to ship 2/10.",
    "attachments": []
