    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 12/08/22  8:01:56 AM: Got on the phone with tech support at Metalforming. The auto tolerance on the a-axis got off somehow. Got it set back and synced up left and right sides. Might be an encoder going bad. Could be due to a bind somewhere. I will monitor.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
