    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "07/09/2026 09:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/09/26  7:36:47 AM: Suction cups that were ordered will not work on these machines. They are too tall with the double bellow. I got with VacMotion. They don't make a suction cup that will fit. We are past our return window. Since we aren't placing another order with them, we can't return the ones we bought that don't fit. I got with Piab and am looking into other options. Hartfiel Automation is our Piab rep. Clayton there sent me a quote for accurate replacements. I need to forward it to Paul and Shacole. | Preston Ellexson - 05/28/26  8:02:39 AM: She doesn't have a preference of when. If I finish the forklift cable early enough, I'll start them today. | Preston Ellexson - 05/27/26  9:32:59 AM: I will get with Shacole on this by end of day or tomorrow to figure out a time to replace these.",
    "attachments": []
  },
