    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "04/30/2026 02:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 04/30/26 12:14:42 PM: Got the conduit cut back in the ceiling. Put small junction box and extended the conduit to the beam behind the old Panfolder. Mounted disconnect and moved charger over. Got wires pulled through. Took longer due to the green wire being too short after I completed my pull. Just had to pull through another wire with the fishtape. Leveled charger, but not going to anchor it. Tied in all power. Double checked fuses and disconnect. Turned on breaker and checked. Everything is working the way it should. | Preston Ellexson - 03/24/26  7:38:29 AM: Shacole got with me on this for an update. I told her I would get this moved next week. I'll have to extend the power to the beam by the older Panfolder. They need to move the dust collector on the Finishline machine, but need the charger moved first. | Preston Ellexson - 02/06/26  6:01:43 AM: I spoke with Shacole and Paul on this previously. This will be done next week after the new installations are completed on my end.",
    "attachments": []
  },
