    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/05/22  9:40:20 AM: Opened the cover on the top of the dust collector. Cleaned out debris. Blew out the motor. Removed and cleaned all old gasket material. Put a new foam seal on in place. The old hinges were both broken. Cut off and ground down smooth. Mounted two new adjustable hinges for the motor cover. Got all put back together and tight. Machine is working good. I would like to replace the wet collector with a standard dust collection system.",
