    "date_notified": "05/28/2024",
    "urgency": "3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",
    "problem": "fladder is making a weird noise, needs to be greased and the conveyor belt (Preston is going to grease today)",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "2",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "05/29/2024 08:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 05/30/24  5:17:28 AM: Greased all points on the machine. Suction motor was running in reverse. Swapped rotation on this so it was right. There is a plug/socket on this, so there isn't any reason to unwire this and have a rotation issue. The side conveyor was pretty noisy. Removed the sprocket/chain cover. Both sprockets were loose and you could move by hand so the chain wasn't riding straight. Got sprockets straight and tightened all set screws. Greased all bearings and adjusted tension on bottom bearings. Greased chain with lithium grease. Put cover back on and tested. No noised at all right now and the conveyor is running good.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "246",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 246",
