    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/10/25  4:55:01 AM: We are not going to move forward with this right now. They are looking at getting a new deburr machine. Not sure if that would replace this machine or not. There isn't an easy way to add a light given the way this machine operates and has to open up on a regular basis. | Preston Ellexson - 06/03/24 12:10:40 PM: Got with Shacole on this. Brought a light to the machine to test temporarily. The location the operator is wanting the light is over 8' from a good mounting place. Shacole is going to follow-up with Paul tomorrow and see what they want to do. I'll proceed from there.",
    "attachments": []
