    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 12/05/22 12:11:12 PM: ETS board blew a capacitor. Ordered a new one. Ran continuity test on foot pedal wiring. Found a short there. Cut off bad and repaired. Tested continuity on pedestal wiring too. No issues there. Replaced board when it arrived. Had to get with Greg @ Capital to help me set parameters on pedestal. Saved and put a copy on press. Machine is running good.",
