    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 12/08/22 12:39:26 PM: Checked continuity on the start button and it is working good. The oil cooler fan was still running with no hydraulics engaged. Powered down and opened the electrical cabinet. The auxiliary contact on the main contactor was stuck in the energized position. Swapped it out with a new one and the machine is working the way it should.",
