    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/10/23 12:27:57 PM: Replaced motor contactor and auxiliary contactor. Tested voltage and everything is good. Calibrated machine and everything runs the way it should. | Preston Ellexson - 03/09/23  4:27:46 AM: With e-stop engaged, the hydraulic fan still runs. When you disengage the e-stop, the machine automatically starts back up without having to press the start button. Found the main contactor sticking and not de-energizing. Removed it and took apart. All contact points were black and heavily pitted. Smoothed, cleaned, and reassembled. Got machine ready to run, but the contactor is too worn out at this point. Ordered more to be sent overnight. Will arrive today and I'll continue repair.",
