    "completed_datetime": "11/03/2022 07:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 11/03/22  5:24:15 AM: Got this done over a month ago. Drained oil and removed motor/pump assembly. Cleaned tank and all parts. Replaced the oil cooler motor. Bearings were shot in the old one. Replaced seals on two valves. Got all put back together with new oil and everything sealed. The return line filter is leaking a little bit, but not much. I am ordering a new gasket for it and will replace it when it arrives. | Preston Ellexson - 06/23/22 10:21:11 AM: *",
