    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 12/05/22 12:16:31 PM: Replaced main motor, eddy current drive, and DSI controller. Still getting the same issue. Called Jeff @ LMG Services and he came out to assess. Found the brake wasn't releasing. Adjusted the flywheel pulley. The parker valve for the brake had broke parts inside. This was allowing the air to bypass the brake and directly out the muffler. He picked up the repair kit, and spare kit, from Fort Worth and came back the next morning to repair. We replaced the counterbalance regulator. Machine is running good.",
