    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "01/25/2024 12:30 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 01/25/24 10:18:22 AM: Replaced palm buttons with new. Put new switches on palm button mount and wired in. I ordered one extra set of switches that fit this size. I will monitor this for a week or so. | Preston Ellexson - 11/29/23  5:57:56 AM: All switches seem to be operating correctly. Fuses are all good. All voltage is good. I am getting with 2 companies to see if we can get some assistance with this issue.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "242",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 242",
    "equipment_name": "Punch Press, 150 ton (WC 2005)",
