    "urgency": "1. Prod Stopped",
    "problem": "Clutch air pressure",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "0.5",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "01/31/2024 06:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 02/02/24  5:34:59 AM: No more issues with this machine. | Preston Ellexson - 01/31/24  4:36:51 AM: Pressure regulator was lower than it typically is for clutch air pressure. Moved from 40psi to 50psi. Adjusted the counter balance due to this increase. Machine is running good right now, but I will leave this open and monitor the remainder of the day.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "242",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 242",
    "equipment_name": "Punch Press, 150 ton (WC 2005)",
    "department": "Fabrication",
    "wo_id": "11777",
    "date_notified": "05/22/2024",
    "urgency": "6. General Maint",
    "problem": "the air valve for the punch is spraying out oil when Ken adjusted it. (Preston has looked at it)",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "160",
    "labor_time": "6",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "05/30/2024 02:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 05/31/24  9:44:30 AM: Remade the entire air setup for the regulators. Made all new to size out of 1/2 black iron. On the outgoing of both regulators, they go up to the top with soft line hoses. Replaced the first filter/lubricator with new. Used existing counter balance regulator. Replaced the clutch regulator with new and it is a filter as well. Drilled/tapped 1/4-20 holes to mount the first filter/lubricator. Put a union in the middle for ease of removal if we need to replace anything in the future. Unlocked air and machine power. Tested everything. Machine is running good with no leaks. | Preston Ellexson - 05/24/24 12:03:02 PM: I will have to re-plumb the air lines. The incoming air is coming from the right side, and I need it to hardline from the left for the new filter/regulator. I will get with Shacole and see if they're running Tuesday so I can do this. If not Tuesday, whatever fits the punch press schedule. | Preston Ellexson - 05/22/24  5:03:24 AM: Got a filter/regulator sent to be ordered. It was late yesterday so it'll get ordered today and deliver tomorrow. I'll repair when the machine isn't being used, or during a setup.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "242",
