    "completed_datetime": "08/08/2023 09:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/04/23 10:57:27 AM: Nothing has been leaking since this work ordered was done. Closing out after monitoring. | Preston Ellexson - 08/08/23  7:15:12 AM: Checked wiring from pedestal to ETS main board. The pedestal overlay was not staying lit up on some of the button. The foot leds were hesitating. Swapped the pedestal overlay with a new one. I think something shorted out and tripped the overload that runs the ram tilt motor. Reset overload and checked the amperage setting. Got all wires tightened back up. Turned machine on and tested. Everything is working good right now. It is leaking from the eccentric shaft on the ram tilt assembly. Awaiting a response from Greg Ott to move forward with repair.",
