    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/21/22  7:40:13 AM: Cylinder is working fine. Pulled rod to maximum extension and put back on the machine. Everything is working good now. Put all machine covers back on 7/20/2022, cleaned entire machine with air, and put safety cage back together. Changed all batteries and put labels. Filled machine with oil. Machine is good to run. | Preston Ellexson - 07/21/22  7:38:29 AM: Put the motor and the needed covers back on. Made sure all wires, couplers, etc were good to run. Turned the machine on and had to manually zero the ram axis. Got with Luke on the custom settings that needed to be adjusted to zero-set. After zero setting the ram, I got it back to normal operation mode. Zero-set everything and all is working. Shacole ran for a day then got an SQ35 error. The cylinder rod for the fulcrum unlock wasn't engaging. I removed the cylinder and tested the rod and seals. | Preston Ellexson - 07/21/22  7:33:54 AM: Ran through some ideas and tested some things out on this machine. Found no issues with the gearbox once I removed the punch holder from the turret and tested in an open tool location. I manually walked the crankshaft all the way around with no binding or issues whatsoever. Removed the spline adapter from the motor and got it chucked up in a hand drill. Inserted the spline into the gearbox and ran on low speed. No bent shafts or bad gears. The drill easily ran the gears around. | Preston Ellexson - 06/22/22  8:20:15 AM: Helped Luke investigate an issue and found a bent shaft in the gearbox. We received a quote for repair but the lead time is 5-7 weeks minimum. I put an expense list together for this machine since January. It was sent to Debbie, Billy, and Paul. I am awaiting a response as to what route to take moving forward.",
    "attachments": []
  },
