    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "07/15/2024 12:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/16/24  4:26:19 AM: Replaced leaking cylinder with new. I will get this one sent out for repair after I swap the ones on BP#44. Removed power and disconnected hydraulic lines. Removed motor plate assembly. Cleaned old gaskets/maker off of the main plate, return filter housing, and the valve block. Replaced these 3 with cork gasket material. Tightened all back down. Doubled checked all fittings. Put motor assembly back on reservoir, got lines tied in, and hooked power wires back up. Turned machine on and only one leak. The o ring on the top plate of the return filter housing was leaking. We didn't have one, but had material to make one. Got one made and let it seal and dry. Put on and tested again. No leaks right now. I am closing this out, but will monitor the remainder of the week. | Preston Ellexson - 06/07/24 12:23:26 PM: Cylinders, seal kits, and filter housing gasket were ordered this week. I will schedule repair time with Shacole and Paul when the parts arrive here. | Preston Ellexson - 05/08/24 11:48:59 AM: I have to send the quote to Paul for approval so we can get this taken care of.",
    "attachments": []
  },
