    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/22/24 11:56:40 AM: Turned machine power off. Removed cover from food pedal and checked switches. They were both engaging at the same time, which will never operate the machine accurately. Adjusted the switches and put cover back on. Turned machine power on, calibrated, and had Eddie run a few parts. No issues at all with the foot pedal. It is working the way it should after being adjusted properly.",
