    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/23/23  4:13:38 AM: Isaac found a set of contacts in the light curtain electrical cabinet that were burnt up. He swapped due to there being extra contacts not being used. Machine has been running good since. | Preston Ellexson - 02/09/23  4:50:54 AM: I have been working with the operators on this machine. Replaced a burned up relay in the electrical cabinet for the light curtains. It was taking more pressure to engage foot pedal switches fully, so I adjusted them both. Still having to hit the pedal multiple times for the ram to engage. Pedestal isn't throwing up any errors other than intended 100 series errors. I am scheduling a tech for this machine and BP#42 today.",
