    "completed_datetime": "07/01/2024 12:00 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/01/24 12:08:18 PM: Replaced transmitter. Jim said the left and right heights were not the same. I leveled both identically at mark 36 and did an alignment. Adjusted what was needed and got everything tight. Had Jim test a program with no issues. I will monitor, but machine is running good. | Preston Ellexson - 06/27/24 12:14:00 PM: Inspected machine and made sure nothing else was giving issues. Got with THCO for the LaserSafe Sentinel Plus safety curtains. They are saying one of the diodes inside the transmitter tends to wear 5-9 years after installation. These are 2017 models. Ordered 2 new transmitters so we'll have one for backup. All press brakes use the same model. They should arrive tomorrow. I'll swap when they show up.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "192",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 192",
    "equipment_name": "Press Brake #44 (WC 2018)",
    "department": "Fabrication",
    "wo_id": "13133",
    "date_notified": "09/20/2024",
    "urgency": "3. Prod Affected, Not Stopped",
    "problem": "the JOG button on the pedestal isn't working (Preston is aware)",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
