    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 11/09/22 12:21:05 PM: Line from valve block to reservoir was leaking. Went to Jimmie's Auto and had one made. Struggled to get it on because it's approx. 1/4\" too long. Went back and had them make a 36\" line with a 45 on it. Looped it around and made sure everything was tight. Turned on machine and tested. No leaks and machine is running good.",
