    "comments": "Scott Herbert - 03/18/25  8:54:52 AM: Closed by PSH....... Will open new W/O if additional maintenance is required. | Preston Ellexson - 08/27/24  4:08:27 AM: Haven't gotten back on this yet. The machine is still running good in foot pedal mode. Unless this becomes more of an issue, I am leaving it for right now. I am leaving the work order open in case something starts up again. | Preston Ellexson - 03/26/24  4:06:23 AM: Inspected machine. It will run good in foot pedal mode. When you change to palm buttons, it'll cycle the ram once but nothing more. The control relays aren't shifting right when in palm button mode. I need to check further to find out what electrical component needs replaced.",
    "attachments": []
