    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 11/02/22  4:21:08 AM: We were getting error that Receiver image is too dark. Called Jeff @ THCO(Guardomation) and he got in touch with one of his technicians. If the A light is lit up on the transmitter, but the red light is very dim or not on, the unit has failed. They sent one overnight. I installed and set the height back to what the original was set at. Machine is running. I think it might need an alignment but Eddie is running to test.",
