    "completed_datetime": "02/02/2023 09:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 03/09/23  4:31:12 AM: Got all done but machine was still having issues. Mark @ Capital came out and found the motor and drive are faulty. Ordered reburbished ones and rescheduled him back out. Came back out 3/3 to swap parts. Got that done and he found a down limit issue and had to make adjustments to the encoder. Drive was running in reverse at times. He got with the factory and adjusted needed parameters. The only issue left is the start-up issue with the top/slow high speed. I am scheduling another visit. | Preston Ellexson - 02/02/23  7:14:10 AM: Error was happening due to the backgauge binding up on the way out. Found a broken carriage bearing. Removed backgauge but left ballscrews and everything else intact. Ordered new bearings for both sides(8). Had to drill openings for bolt removal due to wrong parts being used previously. Got all replaced and adjusted the ways box. Have to adjust the x-axis again due to slop in the mounting holes. Still work in progess.",
    "attachments": []
  },
