    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 04/10/24  5:13:17 AM: We haven't had anymore issues out of this machine. | Preston Ellexson - 03/26/24  8:04:01 AM: Ordered wire to replace pedestal wires going to main board. | Preston Ellexson - 03/26/24  4:29:50 AM: Working with James on this. No strange pedestal errors. The SO cable running from the main drf board to the pedestal has some hard spots in it, but it's functioning fine right now. I will order more to replace. He keeps his foot in the pedal while he is running this operation. I suggested releasing the foot pedal every time to get both of the switches functioning properly. I will see if that changes the issue and we'll go from there.",
