    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/22/24  7:24:23 AM: Followed up with the operators and everything has been running good. No foot pedal issues. | Preston Ellexson - 08/19/24 11:39:34 AM: They were randomly getting 126 Pedestal Power Loss and 906 No AC Power errors. Had Chad turn power off prior to last break. Removed cover and checked foot pedal. Switches were not set right. They were engaging at the same time. Left switch has to hit before the right switch. A few milliseconds between switches energizing is all it needs. Tested manually and put cover back on. Turned power on and calibrated just fine. I will leave open for a day or so to ensure this error doesn't continue. | Preston Ellexson - 08/19/24 11:39:26 AM: They were randomly getting 126 Pedestal Power Loss and 906 No AC Power errors. Had Chad turn power off prior to last break. Removed cover and checked foot pedal. Switches were not set right. They were engaging at the same time. Left switch has to hit before the right switch. A few milliseconds between switches energizing is all it needs. Tested manually and put cover back on. Turned power on and calibrated just fine. I will leave open for a day or so to ensure this error doesn't continue.",
    "attachments": []
  },
