    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/15/25  8:09:28 AM: Removed bolts that hold the light curtain arm on the bracket. Took top plate off and removed the housing with the bearing assembly and the handle lock block. Cleaned everything and greased with white lithium. Threads on handle were bent. Replaced with a similar but new one. Put parts back on the assembly and put top plate on. Got mounted back up and the height set. Light curtain is working good and machine is ready to run. | Preston Ellexson - 10/13/25 10:18:12 AM: I am going to look at this when Chad is done with his current job. He said it will be sometime tomorrow.",
