    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 09/20/22  5:51:20 AM: Added to other open work order. | Preston Ellexson - 09/07/22  4:25:27 AM: It kept showing 92. Manual says nothing useful to troubleshoot. I glanced down the receiver and saw an obstruction at that height. Wiped down transmitter and receiver. Reset and everything is good to run. Vern said it happened again later. He just wiped them down and they were fine. The last time it happened, he made sure the fitting on the receiver was tight, and it has been fine since. We will monitor to ensure there are no more issues.",
