    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/12/22 12:20:54 PM: Machine is running good. If this continues, I will remount the light curtain box on a separate post off of the machine for less vibration. | Preston Ellexson - 09/19/22  9:55:29 AM: Issues started last week. Vern was getting errors within the receiver. 90-100 kept having issues. Cleaned the screens and replaced the receiver cable. Ran good for a couple days. Started acting up again today. I replaced the receiver with a used one. Tested and everything is working good. I will monitor for today and tomorrow before closing out.",
    "attachments": []
