    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/24/22 11:37:37 AM: Removed old box with all internals, and replaced with new. Got all mounted and fix broken mounting bolts. Plugged all in and tested the machine. Everything works and runs the way it should. | Preston Ellexson - 10/22/22  7:44:18 AM: One of the capacitors on the Microguard power circuit board blew. Replaced it and rewired with a used one. When I plug in the main hardness from board to board, I lose all lights on the power board. Got in touch with Jeff @ THCO(Guardomation) and ordered a new power board, and a complete new box with all new parts. It will be a non-mute out box, but for the punch press that won't be an issue. Board arrived, but new assembly won't make it until UPS shows up Monday.",
    "attachments": []
  },
