    "completed_datetime": "01/15/2024 12:00 AM",
    "comments": "Joshua Patton - 01/15/24  7:35:23 AM: removed clutch cover and fond that the nipple was broke that screws in the valve, remove valve and replaced the broken nipple, the reinstalled the valve and put the clutch cover back on the machine. the machine is ready for normal operation.",
