    "completed_datetime": "05/06/2024 10:30 AM",
    "comments": "Scott Herbert - 03/18/25 11:03:36 AM: 3/18/25 PSH: WO closed. No further action needed. | Preston Ellexson - 05/08/24 11:53:13 AM: It seems as if one of the control relays is not de-energizing when it should. I tested in inch mode to see if the machine had the same issue. It acts the same in single or inch which means it more than likely is the relay. Inch mode bypasses some switches so I was using that to see if there was a change in function from single to inch. Got with Shacole to see when they want to schedule.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
