    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/13/23  8:37:06 AM: The leaking jack has been looked at on another work order. Awaiting vendor response on parts availability. Closing without action. | Preston Ellexson - 10/13/23  8:36:55 AM: The leaking jack has been looked at on another work order. Awaiting vendor response on parts availability. Closing without action. | Preston Ellexson - 09/19/23  5:44:13 AM: Inspected jacks. One is leaking a little bit on the bottom of the cylinder. Both top stages were a little dirty, but no oil leaks. I cleaned everything off so I can check again later to see how bad it's leaking. The other jack doesn't appear to have any leaks. It needs some oil, but the oil that's in it needs emptied. I will get a small pump after work and do this tomorrow. Both are still operational, but I am monitoring.",
