    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 08/05/24 10:43:23 AM: I went through all the jacks we have in maintenance. Anything with cylinder leaks, or 2nd stage cylinder issues I am not putting back on the floor. I swapped needed cylinders from bad jacks to good. Got all lift and power switches taken care of. Went through all of our batteries to determine what was good anymore. No more jacks in maintenance right now. I got with Scott moving forward on the pallet jack issue. Hopefully they'll order from Medley so we can purchase repair parts easier. I am following up with him just since everything in maintenance has been fully repaired, or scrapped at this point. | Joshua Patton - 07/09/24  5:39:39 AM: brought to maintenance i am going to put it on the charger to see if the battery is holding charge,",
