    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 09/17/24 11:53:00 AM: They are good with leaving this spring in for now. Just received the back up springs. Told Shacole to let me know if any operator starts having issues due to it. If so I'll swap out when needed. | Preston Ellexson - 08/29/24  5:58:43 AM: Turned power off and removed pedestal to get to the pedals. Spring is broken on the left foot pedal. Switches needed adjusted on the right pedal. We had a stiffer spring here that I used, but I am ordering more of the right one. It is pretty hard to push in comparison to the original. I'm wondering if this might have been tied into the issue we believed was valve related. I am monitoring it today and will swap the spring out when it arrives tomorrow. I will leave this open until next week so I can monitor the machine start-up every morning for any issues.",
    "attachments": []
  },
