    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 10/04/23 10:56:48 AM: Die runs fine with block turned upside down. Nothing further needed right now. | Preston Ellexson - 08/11/23  5:03:24 AM: Got die taken apart. Gave Shacole the rubber piece so Paul can get it ordered. Cleaned the die, top and bottom. Checked all screws and replaced any that were needed. Filed down any sharp edges. I am waiting to put the top and bottom die back together until we have some parts to test it on. Shacole said they have a run next week more than likely. When parts are ready, I will grease the die, re-assemble, and install and test on the machine.",
