    "completed_datetime": "05/05/2026 09:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 05/05/26  7:13:20 AM: Removed all pins from the die. Removed all 4 top plates and all springs. Cleaned old grease from die. Threw all old parts away. Had one set of top plates left. They already come with the u-clip installed. I had to install the new springs on all u-clips. Filled springs holes with lithium grease. Put plate/spring assemblies in die. Set each spring in the pin, one by one. Double checked all were set correctly. Cleaned die and sent back to fabrication for use. | Preston Ellexson - 09/30/25 10:12:26 AM: All parts are here for the die repair. I will get this done as soon as I have time. I'll aim to get these dies repaired next week. | Preston Ellexson - 08/08/25  4:26:56 AM: Sent the quote to be ordered today. | Preston Ellexson - 07/28/25 12:24:13 PM: Sent a quote request to Capital today. | Preston Ellexson - 07/02/25  5:38:09 AM: Got with Shacole. We don't have any springs here to repair. She is getting with Paul to see if they want to proceed with any repairs. I'll let them know what to order if we proceed. | Preston Ellexson - 07/01/25 10:01:42 AM: Getting with Shacole on this. I believe we'll have to order parts for any more repairs.",
    "attachments": []
  },
