    "completed_datetime": "04/06/2023 08:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 04/07/23 12:20:46 PM: Had to get calibration procedure from Mid Atlantic Global. Tried procedure twice the day before with no luck. Got on video chat yesterday morning and we got the machine calibrated properly with help from their tech. Machine is running good aside from full belt size parts. I have a quote for PM service I will proceed with Monday.",
