    "problem": "conveyor belt not moving",
    "status": "Closed and Completed",
    "material_cost": "0",
    "labor_time": "12",
    "work_performed_by": "Preston/Jimmie @ Mid Atlantic Global",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "06/28/2023 02:30 PM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 07/10/23 11:15:19 AM: Found the drive roller had sheared off at the shaft going into the gearbox. Put new one on when it arrived and followed procedure. Kept having issues so we scheduled Jimmie to come out and we went ahead and bought a new conveyor belt so it would be here if needed. He got the old one working after many adjustments over 2 days. Kept the new one for a backup, but as of now the machine is running good. It is fully usable at the entire width. Jimmie also went over a few different setup styles with the operators. Machine has been running good since. | Preston Ellexson - 05/04/23 12:08:05 PM: Drive roller shipped today from overseas. Should be here within 1-2 weeks. | Preston Ellexson - 04/24/23 11:45:14 AM: Flange got caught up in the machine. Jimmie got removed by cutting it out in pieces. When they tried to run machine, the conveyor isn't moving. We checked a handful of things and moved the belt and brushes out of the way. The motor and gear box for the conveyor belt is running good and not hot at all. The conveyor has something obstructing it from moving. Called Jimmy @ Mid-Atlantic Global. He said remove belt tension to inspect. He is going to send the process for resetting the conveyor belt tension. I ordered a torque wrench today, as our 3 weren't within the range we needed. Heading over to start working on.",
    "attachments": []
  },
  {
    "equipment_id": "2057",
    "equipment_eq_id": "EQ ID 2057",
