    "work_performed_by": "Preston",
    "assigned_to": "Maintenance",
    "downtime_hours": "0",
    "completed_datetime": "01/26/2024 10:00 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 01/30/24  6:19:44 AM: After testing multiple different things, the manufacturer was suggesting to take the motor in question apart. I watched their video and decided to double check the relay in question before removing the motor. The relay wasn't seated correctly causing it to not energize properly. Got it reseated and everything is working good now. They have been running this for days with no issues. | Preston Ellexson - 01/22/24  6:38:07 AM: I have been working on this since 1/18 with our technician Jimmy and the manufacturer. Still sending back and forth to determine root cause.",
    "attachments": []
  },
