    "completed_datetime": "12/19/2025 09:30 AM",
    "comments": "Preston Ellexson - 12/19/25  7:19:36 AM: Got the machine fixed. Nothing is bound up. Everything is moving free by hand now. The table height needs to be calibrated now. We have the procedure, but need the password. I am awaiting a response from Jimmy and I will forward to Shacole and Jimmie to proceed. They can do this without me. Aside from this calibration, the machine is ready and safe to run. | Preston Ellexson - 12/19/25  4:56:21 AM: Tried manually working the table height down. It is in enough of a bind it won't go up or down without trying to skip the chain on the gearbox sprocket. Got with Jimmie @ Mid Atlantic Global 12/12. He ran through a procedure to release the belt tension from the table so I can manually move the table height down. I am working on this today.",
